<title>UK: CRICKET-PAKISTAN NEED 48 RUNS TO WIN THIRD AND FINAL TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN NEED 48 RUNS TO WIN THIRD AND FINAL TEST.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were dismissed for 242 in their second innings on the fifth day of the third and final test at The Oval on Monday leaving Pakistan requiring 48 runs to win.</p>
<p>Pakistan lead the series 1-0.</p>
</text>
